        "Content": "Stunning 4 bedroom detached family residence extending to C. 135 sq.m. (1,453 sq.ft.). This private rural location, gives you the opportunity for peace and quiet set amongst its mature c. 0.7 acre grounds. Upon arrival you will appreciate the wonderful atmosphere created by its present owners with the entire house tastefully decorated and maintained to an excellent standard throughout. The accommodation consists of light filled rooms that are well-proportioned, and are complimented outside by the large landscaped gardens including multiple patio seating areas, garden room & a large block built garage. Located in the village centre of Tenure, yet less than 2km to the M1 Motorway giving access to Dublin & Belfast. Within easy access to Drogheda Town Centre within 15 minutes drive and just a short drive to local schools, this is a quality home ideal for any purchaser who requires a property tastefully finished and in walk in condition.\n\nAMV - 485,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures \n4 Bedroom Detached Property\nBuilt C. 1996\nC. 0.7 Acre Site\nExtends to C. 135 sq.m. (1,453 sq.ft.)\n*Fibre Broadband Available*\nO-F-C-H High Efficiency Boiler\nMulti Fuel Stove Back Boiler Unit\nUpgraded Cavity Wall Insulation\nWater Private Well\nWaste Septic Tank\nDouble & Triple Glazing Throughout\nPrivate Site\nGarden Room (4.38m x 3.43m)\nStira Stairs Floored Attic Storage\nBlock Built Garage Heating & Elec (9.06m x 5.60m)\nLoft Space Above Garage & Elec Roller Shutter\nVehicular Side Access to Garage\nAmple Parking Stoned Front Driveway\nExternal Elec Sockets\nFront Security Gates Option For Elec\n\nAccommodation Includes \nEntrance Hall\nLiving Room(4.83m x 4.30m)\nKitchen / Dining(6.36m x 4.40m)\nUtility Room(2.37m x 3.13m) \nBathroom(2.11m x 1.82m) \nBedroom 3(3.65m x 3.12m) \nBedroom 4(3.13m x 2.63m)\n\n\n1st Floor\nLanding\nBedroom 1(3.73m x 2.24m) (0.97m x 2.58m)\nEn Suite(2.20m x 2.63m)\nBedroom 2(5.17m x 3.83m) \n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: 